sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Maintainer
    participant Ctrl as MaintenanceController
    participant Service as MaintenanceService
    participant DB as Database

    note right of Client: POST /maintenance/issues/:id/prove
    Client->>Ctrl: ProveIssueDto
    activate Ctrl

    Ctrl->>Service: proveIssue(maintainerAccountId, issueId, dto)
    activate Service
    
    Service->>DB: Check staff & assignment
    DB-->>Service: StaffInfo + IssueAssignment

    alt Staff not found or not assigned
        Service-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
    end

    Service->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    Service->>DB: INSERT Prove + UPDATE Issue status='Resolved'
    Service->>DB: COMMIT
    DB-->>Service: MaintenanceProve

    Service-->>Ctrl: MaintenanceProve
    deactivate Service
    
    Ctrl-->>Client: 201 Created
    deactivate Ctrl